# Don't ship build artefacts or local config into the image.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Local config / secrets
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.json.example
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs / scratch
**/HANDOFF.md
**/README.md
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*

# Frontend lives in a separate folder anyway, but belt-and-braces:
chatverse-client/
ChatVerse__FrontEnd/
node_modules/

# Logs
*.log
logs/
